    info
        - `Yaml is Encodable in Yaml`: a document encodes as itself
        + `Yaml is Encodable in Yaml` : un document s'encode en lui-même
    detail
        - The identity encoder, the counterpart of `.yaml`: a `Yaml`-typed field is spliced into
